# Requested authority only; the existing launch path remains in control.
# The platform power object (KERN-004) is for the kernel-object Call phase:
# the client only asks for S3, which the kernel refuses (Not_Yet) after the
# whole Call path (handle resolution, message decode, admission, reply).
(Executable_Manifest
  identity => "com.cubit.bench.ipc.client"
  version => "1.0.0"
  requests => [(service "ipc-test" "ipc-test") (Request.Platform_Power "power")])
